late.txt
ran.txt

# Julius single-file inspection export (regenerate: node scripts/export-julius-harness.mjs).
# Derived, not source of truth; the generator and JULIUS_HARNESS_MANIFEST.md are committed instead.
generated/
# The restart/recovery drill's own output: a transcript and an attestation, both
# written at run time and only meaningful beside the run that produced them.
julius-capability-proofs/
# The live-mission evidence bundle name, so a local dry run of the workflow's
# collection step or the dump script does not leave one in the working tree.
julius-live-evidence/

# Unreal per-checkout build output and editor state. Regenerated by
# "Generate project files" + a WonderlandEditor build, and 2+ GiB of it, so it
# is per-checkout exactly as dist-relay/ is.
#
# Content/ and Config/ are deliberately NOT ignored: the hub map and the engine
# configuration are source, and the map is the one asset the startup path
# depends on.
wonderland/Binaries/
wonderland/Intermediate/
wonderland/Saved/
wonderland/DerivedDataCache/
wonderland/.vs/
wonderland/*.sln
